title WSO2 Allocation

component allocation-web as "Allocation Web" web-application
component allocation-api as "Allocation API" service
component allocation-db as "Allocation DB" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south hr-entity-service as "People App (HR Entity Service)" service
south email-service as "Email Service" service
south erp-service as "NetSuite" service

north -> allocation-web
north -> allocation-api

allocation-web -> allocation-api
allocation-web -> user-auth
allocation-api -> user-auth
allocation-api -> allocation-db
allocation-api -> hr-entity-service
allocation-api -> email-service
allocation-api -> erp-service
